      "id": "2124021085008208082",
      "text": "The Mavericks are technically in first place via point differential tiebreaker because of Fred VanVleet’s 50-foot buzzer beater. They’re +17 to Denver’s +16 after that. But with Nuggets-Mavericks head-to-head matchup coming next week, it’s unlikely to matter.",
